" -X POST http://localhost:4000/anthropic-direct/v1/messages -H "Authorization: Bearer $JWT" -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d "$BODY"` 2. Output ``` 403 {"error":{"message":"No team has access to the requested model: claude-sonnet-4-5. Checked teams={'internal-team-1'}. Check `/models` to see all available models.","type":"auth_error","param":"None","code":"403"}} ``` ### After (07416344cc) #### Route under the granted prefix 1. `curl -s -o out.json -w "%{http_code}
" -X POST http://localhost:4000/internal-models/anthropic/v1/messages -H "Authorization: Bearer $JWT" -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d "$BODY"` 2. Output, a real Anthropic response, no exact-route config entry for it ``` 200 {"model":"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929","id":"msg_011CeF5n4PZqyoEeapsvvype","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Hello to you!"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","usage":{"input_tokens":14,...}} ``` #### Route outside the granted prefix 1. `curl -s -o out.json -w "%{http_code}
